# Grinder Salad Sandwich

Based on [https://cookingwithayeh.com/grinder-salad-viral-tiktok-recipe/…](https://cookingwithayeh.com/grinder-salad-viral-tiktok-recipe/#recipe) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250429072459/https://cookingwithayeh.com/grinder-salad-viral-tiktok-recipe/))

{ rating="4" image="grinder_salad_sandwich.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Dressing

- [ ] 1 Tbsp [mayo]{ ing="mayo" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [red wine vinegar]{ ing="red-wine-vinegar" }
- [ ] 1 tsp extra [virgin olive oil]{ ing="virgin-olive-oil" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [oregano]{ ing="oregano" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [minced garlic]{ ing="minced-garlic" } or 1/4 tsp garlic powder
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }

### Salad

- [ ] [Iceberg lettuce]{ ing="iceberg-lettuce" }, thinly sliced
- [ ] [Red or yellow onion]{ ing="red-or-yellow-onion" }, sliced
- [ ] [Cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }, sliced
- [ ] 2-3 [Banana peppers]{ ing="banana-peppers" } or pepperoncino sliced

### Sandwich

- [ ] [Bread]{ ing="bread" }
- [ ] [Tomato]{ ing="tomato" }, sliced with a dash of salt and pepper
- [ ] [Cheese]{ ing="cheese" }, sliced
- [ ] [Deli meat]{ ing="deli-meat" } or other protein

## Recipe

1. In a tupperware, mix the dressing, then toss with the [lettuce]{ ing="iceberg-lettuce" } and veggies. Leftovers can be saved in the fridge
1. Assemble the sandwich
